  "description": "A non-medical longitudinal structural observation dataset consisting of 126 same-region observation frames collected between 2026-03-27 and 2026-07-22. The dataset demonstrates the application of the CS-NRRM™ continuity-preserved structural observation approach to a longitudinal observation context separate from the original 12-year vitiligo archive.",

